  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pypa/virtualenv/zipball/21.15.12",
  "body": "<a name=\"release-21-15-12-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Make seed images in app-data read-only, including their directories on POSIX. In a `--symlink-app-data` environment `pip install --ignore-installed` of a seed package now fails with a permission error instead of changing the image shared with other environments. Bytecode cache directories and copied seed packages stay writable ([#3757](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3757)) by @gaborbernat. ([#3620](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3620))\n- Isolate custom-index seed wheels in app-data. Without a custom index setting, a private wheel can fill a missing pin in a dedicated cache. Upgraders must download pins missing from the bundle again before going offline. Old cached wheels and images remain on disk ([#3756](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3756)) by @gaborbernat.\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/virtualenv/21.15.12/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.15.11...21.15.12)\n",
